Package: afcestDataCheck
Title: Survey Data Quality Checks for Development Projects
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cedric", "Bationo", , "cedric@afcest.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Comprehensive high-frequency data quality checks for agricultural,
    health, and socioeconomic surveys. 65+ check functions across 13 categories:
    identification, metadata, completeness, outliers, enumerator performance,
    timing, GPS validation, fabrication detection, logic consistency, text
    quality, back-check reconciliation, paradata, and corrections. Includes
    orchestrator (run_all_checks), Excel/CSV export, and multi-platform
    normalizer for KoBoToolbox, SurveyCTO, ODK Central, Survey Solutions,
    and CSPro.
